ldren_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"水經註：馮翊雲陽縣有石門山。括地志：在雍州三原縣西北三十二里。又曰：堯門山，俗名石門，上有路，其狀若門。故老云：堯鑿山爲門，因名之。武德中於此山南置石門縣，貞觀中改雲陽縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"水经注：冯翊云阳县有石门山。括地志：在雍州三原县西北三十二里。又曰：尧门山，俗名石门，上有路，其状若门。故老云：尧凿山为门，因名之。武德中于此山南置石门县，贞观中改云阳县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc70b-db0e-11ef-b8d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔穎達","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔颖达","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc719-db0e-11ef-a4ce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"黼者，刺繡爲斧形；黻者，刺繡爲兩「己」相背。孔穎達曰：白與黑謂之黼，黑與青謂之黻。黼，音甫。黻，音弗。","note_content_jianti_auto":"黼者，刺绣为斧形；黻者，刺绣为两「己」相背。孔颖达曰：白与黑谓之黼，黑与青谓之黻。黼，音甫。黻，音弗。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc718-db0e-11ef-b039-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-424,"link_death_year":-362,"link_td_description":"秦献公，嬴姓，战国时期秦国君主，秦灵公之子，在位23年。","link_td_id":"Q10001804","link_td_number_id":176315,"people_name":"秦獻公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦献公","people_xingming":"嬴师隰","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc71a-db0e-11ef-8209-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[嬴师隰]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"三晋","resolved_place_entity_id":112,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc71b-db0e-11ef-be33-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石門","place_name_jianti_auto":"石门","resolved_place_entity_id":1102,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc71c-db0e-11ef-83b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"河西之战（后期）","tongjian_id":"war_N0507"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又有浮山，在县北二十里。○嶻嶭山，在县西北四十里，与泾阳...","context_before":"...山亦名石门山，两崖峻险，途出其中。相传尧凿山为门，因名。","source_end_index":75,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5db673fd-276c-54a1-86a3-b953f509e05a","source_start_index":53,"source_text":"周显王五年，秦献公败三晋之师于石门，盖即此。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"今有石门巡司]。","context_before":"...。谓此也。或云唐石门县，盖以山名。今两山壁立，其状如门。","source_end_index":106,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"422659a0-d2d4-5e4a-bd1d-19f79bc02f5f","source_start_index":80,"source_text":"《史记》：秦献公二十二年，与晋战于石门。疑即此地云。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1秦獻公敗三晉之師于石門，斬首六萬。王賜以黼黻之服。","content_fanyi":"秦献公率军在石门击败魏、韩、赵三国联军，斩首六万。周显王把绣有黑白、黑青相间黼黻花纹的礼服赏赐给秦献公。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦献公败三晋之师于石门，斩首六万。王赐以黼黻之服。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":118,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc70a-db0e-11ef-b4ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"五年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c1dc708-db0e-11ef-a291-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丁巳、前三六四）","year_int":-364},"message":"success","success":true}